msgstr "在选定网格上切换网格修复器？"

msgid "Switch"
msgstr "切换"

msgid "Computation is in progress..."
msgstr "计算进行中……"

msgid "Object"
msgstr "对象"

msgid "Inspect and Repair"
msgstr "检查和修复"

msgid "Advanced Mode"
msgstr "高级模式"

msgid "Repair Selected"
msgstr "修复选定项"

msgid "Selection"
msgstr "选区"

msgid "Save Selection on Exit"
msgstr "退出时保存选区"

msgid "Save selection after closing the tool."
msgstr "关闭工具后保存选区。"

msgid "Mesh Healer: Delete Selection"
msgstr "网格修复器：删除选区"

msgid ""
"Deletes faces that are now selected in mesh, it could simplify fixing some "
"issues.\n"
"(Del)"
msgstr ""
"删除网格中当前选中的面，这有助于简化某些问题的修复。\n"
"(Del)"

msgid "Printability Checks"
msgstr "可打印性检查"

msgid "Restart on Mesh Selection Change"
msgstr "网格选择更改时重启"

msgid ""
"The Mesh Healer tool will automatically restart when you select a different "
"mesh from the list."
msgstr "当您从列表中选择不同的网格时，网格修复器工具将自动重启。"

msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

msgid "Load Settings"
msgstr "加载设置"

msgid "Auto Rebuild Model"
msgstr "自动重建模型"

msgid "Select Mesh Issues"
msgstr "选择网格问题"

msgid "MeshHealer: deselect"
msgstr "网格修复器：取消选择"

msgid "Inspect"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "Update Checked"
msgstr "已更新选中项"

msgid "Some mesh issues remain. Please consider using Rebuild Model"
msgstr "仍有部分网格问题未解决。请考虑使用“重建模型”"

msgid "Repair Resolution"
msgstr "修复分辨率"

msgid ""
"Maximum distance the healed mesh may deviate from the original surface "
"(tolerance). Choose a value that matches or is finer than your intended "
"printing resolution."
msgstr ""
"修复后的网格可能偏离原始表面的最大距离（容差）。请选择与目标打印分辨率匹配或"
"更精细的值。"

msgid "Show Deviation Map"
msgstr "显示偏差图"

msgid ""
"Visualize differences between the original and repaired mesh. Red highlights "
"areas where the mesh has been added, while blue shows where material has "
"been removed. This color-coded map helps you easily spot changes."
msgstr ""
"可视化原始网格与修复后网格之间的差异。红色高亮显示网格被添加的区域，蓝色显示"
"材料被移除的区域。这种彩色映射可帮助您轻松发现变化。"

msgid "Discrete Palette"
msgstr "离散调色板"

msgid ""
"If checked, palette will have several discrete levels. Otherwise it will be "
"smooth."
msgstr "若选中，调色板将具有多个离散等级。否则将为平滑过渡。"

msgid "Local Repair"
msgstr "局部修复"

msgid ""
"Fixes mesh inconsistencies locally, without altering the entire model. You "
"can choose to repair all or only selected types of issues."
msgstr ""
"在不更改整个模型的情况下局部修复网格不一致问题。您可以选择修复全部或仅选定类"
"型的问题。"

msgid "Auto Repair"
msgstr "自动修复"

msgid ""
"Rebuilds the entire model, resolving all mesh issues based on the selected "
"printing resolution. Higher accuracy improves precision but may increase "
"computation time."
msgstr ""
"重建整个模型，根据所选打印分辨率解决所有网格问题。更高的精度可提高精确度，但"
"可能增加计算时间。"

msgid "Detection Settings"
msgstr "检测设置"

msgid "Repair Settings"
msgstr "修复设置"

msgid "How to convert intermediate voxels representation into final mesh"
msgstr "如何将中间的体素表示转换为最终网格"

msgid "Close All Holes"
msgstr "关闭所有孔"

msgid ""
"Whether to close all holes (even larger than the threshold in settings) in "
"generalized winding number mode."
msgstr "在广义环绕数模式下是否关闭所有孔（即使大于设置中的阈值）。"

msgid "Auto Repair Mesh"
msgstr "自动修复网格"

msgid "Repair Mesh"
msgstr "修复网格"

msgid "Disconnected Parts"
msgstr "未连接部分"

msgid ""
"When mesh components intersect, they can cause 3D printing problems. Mesh "
"Healer fixes this by joining large intersecting parts through Boolean Union "
"operations and removing smaller ones."
msgstr ""
"当网格组件相互相交时，可能引发 3D 打印问题。Mesh Healer 通过布尔并运算合并相"
"交的大块部分，并移除较小的部分以解决此问题。"

msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

msgid "Small components are removed during repair operation."
msgstr "小组件将在修复操作中被移除。"

msgid "Large"
msgstr "大"

msgid "Large components are united during repair operation."
msgstr "大组件将在修复操作中被合并。"

msgid ""
"Holes can disrupt workflows. Mesh Healer fills small holes to ensure model "
"integrity."
msgstr "孔洞可能会打断工作流程。Mesh Healer 通过填充小孔洞来保证模型完整性。"

msgid "Small holes are filled during repair operation."
msgstr "小孔洞将在修复操作中被填充。"

msgid "To fix large holes please go to Fill Holes plugin or rebuild model."
msgstr "要修复大孔洞，请使用「填充孔洞」插件或重建模型。"

msgid "Self-Intersections"
msgstr "自相交"

msgid ""
"Self-intersections create geometric irregularities that Mesh Healer resolves "
"by optimizing the model's topology."
msgstr ""
"自相交会产生几何不规则性，Mesh Healer 通过优化模型拓扑结构来解决该问题。"

msgid "Zero-Area Triangles"
msgstr "零面积三角形"

msgid ""
"Zero-Area Triangles (degeneracies) are situations where geometric elements, "
"such as points, lines, or faces, become less well-defined, which can lead to "
"inaccuracies and errors. Mesh Healer address degeneracies by automatically "
"resolving them."
msgstr ""
"零面积三角形（退化）是指点、线或面等几何元素的定义不充分的情况，可能导致不准"
"确性和错误。Mesh Healer 通过自动解决退化来应对此类问题。"

msgid "Flipped Normals"
msgstr "翻转的法线"

msgid ""
"Flipped normals can cause incorrect geometry interpretation. Mesh Healer "
"detects and corrects flipped normals to ensure proper surface orientation."
msgstr ""
"翻转的法线可能导致几何形状被错误解释。Mesh Healer 检测并修正翻转的法线，以确"
"保表面方向正确。"

msgid "Small Tunnels"
msgstr "小隧道"

msgid ""
"Small tunnel faces can be problematic as they may lead to printing "
"difficulties, rendering artifacts, or inaccuracies in simulations, "
"potentially compromising the overall quality and functionality of the model. "
"Mesh Healer address small tunnel faces to ensure a more robust and reliable "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"小隧道面可能引发问题，可能导致打印困难、渲染瑕疵或仿真不准确，从而影响模型的"
"整体质量与功能。Mesh Healer 通过处理小隧道面来确保更稳健可靠的表达。"

msgid "Undercuts"
msgstr "凹切"

msgid ""
"Undercuts can be problematic in 3D printing and manufacturing processes "
"because they can hinder the removal of support structures, complicate mold "
"design for traditional manufacturing methods like injection molding, and may "
"require additional processing steps to address the challenges posed by the "
"geometry, potentially increasing production time and costs."
msgstr ""
"凹切在 3D 打印和制造过程中可能会带来问题，可能阻碍支撑结构的移除，使注塑成型"
"等传统制造方法的模具设计复杂化，并可能需要额外的加工步骤来应对几何形状带来的"
